<resources>
    <string name="battery_experiment_title">Battery A/B measurement</string>
    <string name="battery_experiment_instructions">Measurement of whole-device battery consumption. First connect Tailscale and keep protection enabled; disable WireGuard and SOCKS5. Reserve a run, unplug all charging cables, and turn the screen off within 30 minutes. Each condition has a 15-minute settling period. Default: about 6½ hours total. No PC or root is needed.</string>
