    <string name="battery_experiment_not_ready">Keep protection and Tailscale connected, disable other egress modes, and allow exact alarms before reserving. The run may also have failed to save or schedule.</string>
    <string name="battery_experiment_alarm_permission">Exact alarm permission is required. Allow Alarms &amp; reminders for this app, then reserve again.</string>
    <string name="battery_experiment_caveat">This measures the whole device, not Tailscale alone. A single night does not establish causation. Repeat on another night in the opposite order. A dash means the sample is missing or inconsistent. Interrupted runs are not valid comparisons. Switching reconfigures the VPN; settling and switching are excluded. Screen use, charging, network changes, or relevant settings changes stop the run.</string>
